{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hand-Painted Journey Into the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your adventure in a finely crafted hand-drawn world. Explore the \u201cFaceless City\u201d as the Scythe Maiden, uncover the truth behind the mutiny of the Tomorrow\u2019s Flower Legion, and fight to save the Weirdkin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Faceless City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This strange metropolis is shrouded in black mist year-round. Its districts are isolated, with only the societal elite allowed to travel between them via \u201ctrains.\u201d Ordinary residents are confined to fragmented zones, unable to grasp the city's full structure. As a result, the people have come to call it the Faceless City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region, shaped by the ever-present mist, has developed its own distinct geography, culture, and atmosphere. Your journey through these divided zones will be one of mystery, beauty, and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast and Fluid Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a scythe that symbolizes death and engage in thrilling real-time combat. Combine a wide variety of attack chains and freely mix 15 unique skill types to unleash satisfying, high-impact combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/901e860b55e3241f7cf19a1c2423fd76.avif?t=1771912313\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras_big/901e860b55e3241f7cf19a1c2423fd76.avif?t=1771912313 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/c7ebcd0613fb9e18c6e48ddaa2989f32.poster.avif?t=1771912313\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/c7ebcd0613fb9e18c6e48ddaa2989f32.webm?t=1771912313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/c7ebcd0613fb9e18c6e48ddaa2989f32.mp4?t=1771912313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Exquisite Hand-Drawn Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a stunning 2D world brought to life through frame-by-frame and grid-by-grid hand-drawn animation. From dynamic combat sequences to narrative-driven comic panels, every frame is crafted with care and artistry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against dozens of powerful bosses, each boasting visually striking attacks and multi-phase mechanics. Survive, adapt, and overcome as you encounter one deadly foe after another.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/c62e7d7fe7f27284349bfb96f0be1b71.poster.avif?t=1771912313\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/c62e7d7fe7f27284349bfb96f0be1b71.webm?t=1771912313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/c62e7d7fe7f27284349bfb96f0be1b71.mp4?t=1771912313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Character Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character through a robust progression system featuring a talent tree, skill upgrades, equipment, and a pet system. Scavenge for materials, uncover hidden treasures, and grow stronger as you advance through the city\u2019s layered world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/extras/e83de751f33632afdb0075582270306d.avif?t=1771912313\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3193330?t=1771912313","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3193330?t=1771912313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/6f6f780852c5cc2a09b401972f46aec4e654eec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771912313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193330/6f6f780852c5cc2a09b401972f46aec4e654eec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771912313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3826220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hand-Painted Journey Into the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your adventure in a finely crafted hand-drawn world. Explore the \u201cFaceless City\u201d as the Scythe Maiden, uncover the truth behind the mutiny of the Tomorrow\u2019s Flower Legion, and fight to save the Weirdkin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Faceless City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This strange metropolis is shrouded in black mist year-round. Its districts are isolated, with only the societal elite allowed to travel between them via \u201ctrains.\u201d Ordinary residents are confined to fragmented zones, unable to grasp the city's full st